WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.930
For many years, Britain
was heavily involved in the

2
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.270
transatlantic slave trade.

3
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:08.110
Enslaved African people were
shipped across the Atlantic,

4
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:12.230
in brutal conditions,
to work on plantations.

5
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.070
Campaigners fought
for years to end it.

6
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:19.790
Two dates matter: eighteen-oh-seven,
and eighteen thirty-three.

7
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.430
Why are there two dates?

8
00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.450
What did each one abolish?

9
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.350
In this mission, you'll
trace the triangular trade,

10
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.910
and meet campaigners such as
Olaudah Equiano and William

11
00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.230
Wilberforce.

12
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.330
And you'll see Britain's empire
grow to be the largest the

13
00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:36.370
world had ever seen.

14
00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:39.730
Your mission: explain what was
abolished in eighteen-oh-seven,

15
00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:42.670
and what in eighteen thirty-three.
